header: "---\nname: co-marketing-term-sheet-builder\ndescription: \"Draft the commercial skeleton of a co-marketing or joint-venture arrangement before legal drafting starts: rights, spend splits, fund usage rules, lead ownership and exit terms. Use once a target agrees to explore a partnership and always before any draft agreement is written or shared externally.\"\nrisk: medium\nsource: agyos-blueprint\ndate_added: '2026-11-19'\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
